title: Workspace
description: Everything at a workspace's address. Its members see its projects, members, and billing, and inside a project its document tree, whiteboards, and pages. Anyone sees a public project, read-only, at the same address.
color: blue
connects:
  - to: src/components/tree
    label: project tree
  - to: src/components/whiteboard
    label: whiteboards
  - to: src/components/editor
    label: pages
  - to: src/lib/github
    label: Import from GitHub
  - to: src/lib/sync
    label: read-only sync
    description: Visitors to a public project hold no Realtime connection. They re-read the document's snapshot and update log every 20 seconds while the tab is visible, and the same request is their heartbeat for the "N watching" count.
  - to: src/lib/supabase
    label: queries as the member
    description: Routes and server actions query Supabase with the member's session. A viewer who calls an editor's action is refused by the database, not only by the interface.
  - to: src/app/api
    label: export API
    description: |
      Export project builds its zip in the browser, from two routes the member's session can read. Row-level security decides what comes back.

      ```yaml
      openapi: 3.1.0
      info: { title: Subcanvas export, version: "1" }
      paths:
        /api/projects/{projectId}/export:
          get:
            summary: Folders and documents, laid out
            responses:
              "200": { description: Project and layout }
              "404": { description: Not yours to read }
        /api/projects/{projectId}/export/documents:
          get:
            summary: Some of its documents, converted
            parameters:
              - { name: ids, in: query, required: true }
            responses:
              "200":
                description: A JSON line per document
                content:
                  application/x-ndjson:
                    schema:
                      oneOf:
                        - { title: Page }
                        - { title: Whiteboard }
                        - { title: Unreadable }
              "400": { description: 1 to 50 ids }
      ```
